    <node id="Anvers">
      <data key="d0">Anvers</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Anvers is a substation location that hosts several busbar sections at 220.0 kV voltage level.&lt;SEP&gt;Anvers is a station location associated with a busbar section operating at a nominal voltage of 225 kV.&lt;SEP&gt;Anvers is a substation that contains a voltage level 220.0 and is associated with topological node BE-Busbar_2.&lt;SEP&gt;Anvers is a substation where energy consumer L-1230804819 is located at voltage level 220.0.&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-008</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1781186510</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="BE-Busbar_2">
      <data key="d0">BE-Busbar_2</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">BE-Busbar_2 is a topological node representing a busbar connection point for AC line segments.&lt;SEP&gt;BE-Busbar_2 is a topological node representing a busbar section at station Anvers operating at a nominal voltage of 225 kV.&lt;SEP&gt;BE-Busbar_2 is a busbar section installed in voltage level 220.0 of substation Anvers and operates at a nominal voltage of 225.0 kV. It is also referenced as a topological node.&lt;SEP&gt;BE-Busbar_2 is a topological node connected to substation Anvers and energy consumer L-1230804819.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-008</data>
