    <node id="PP_Brussels">
      <data key="d0">PP_Brussels</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">PP_Brussels is a substation location that hosts several busbar sections at different voltage levels.&lt;SEP&gt;PP_Brussels is a substation where busbar section BE-Busbar_4 is installed in voltage level 10.5.&lt;SEP&gt;PP_Brussels is a substation where multiple power transformers are installed.&lt;SEP&gt;PP_Brussels is a substation where synchronous machine BE-G1 is installed.&lt;SEP&gt;PP_Brussels is a substation that contains voltage levels 110.0 and 380.0 and is associated with several shunt compensators and energy consumers.&lt;SEP&gt;PP_Brussels is a substation with voltage levels including 21.0 and 225.0 where machines and loads are connected.&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-008</data>
