      <data key="d2">BE_TR_BUS2 is a topological node that serves as an electrical connection point for several AC line segments.&lt;SEP&gt;BE_TR_BUS2 is a topological node corresponding to busbar section BE-Busbar_1.&lt;SEP&gt;BE_TR_BUS2 is a topological node connected to AC line segments BE-Line_3 and BE-Line_5.&lt;SEP&gt;BE_TR_BUS2 is a topological node to which BE-TR2_1 Winding 1 is connected.&lt;SEP&gt;BE_TR_BUS2 is a topological node in substation PP_Brussels where linear shunt compensator BE_S2 is installed.</data>
